DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T210000
SUMMARY:Trivia night at Shady oaks barrel house
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nDetails at the bot
 tom.\n\nGet ready to flex your brainpower and enjoy some fresh beer at Tri
 via Night hosted at Shady oaks barrel house! Join us for an evening of fri
 endly competition\, delicious drinks\, and the chance to showcase your kno
 wledge on a variety of topics.\n\nJoin our team as we embark on a quest fo
 r victory in a series of engaging trivia rounds. From general knowledge to
  pop culture. Sip on refreshing brews\, indulge in tasty bites\, and let t
 he good times roll while we win some prizes!\n\nWe look forward to seeing 
 you there for a night of brain-teasing fun and friendly faces!\n\ndetails:
 \n\nTrivia starts at 7pm and will go until about 9pm\, there are 4 rounds 
 with a halfway break if you don't want to stay the entire time. They have 
 food at the brewery if you wanted food as well.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/317096805/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261022T224837Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T224837Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
